  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Palau Independent Power Producer - Solar Generation and Battery Energy Storage System (BESS) - AIFFP loan to Solar Pacific Pristine Power Inc</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This financing package to Solar Pacific Pristine Power Inc. supports the construction of a solar and battery storage facility at Ngatpang on Babeldaob in Palau. The facility connects to the Palau Public Utilities Corporation&#x2019;s electricity grid. The loan disbursement for 2022-23 is listed below under &#x2018;Spend Over Financial Years&#x2019; . The &#x2018;Spend 2023-24&#x2019; for is $0 because there were no loan disbursements in the financial year.</narrative>
  </description>
